  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Shifters.HintZone
  RealHint: Heavier side sinks. Put the Sprinter and the Brainiac on PEOPLE (120-140 kg), then the Brute shoves the 160 kg block into the CARGO pit. Upstairs, a lever unlocks the freight stairs for the Brute.
  VagueHint: Somebody goes up, something goes down. That's physics. Or office politics.
